# The year in numbers
Northwind Ops, 2026 — a table, then four charts.

---
section: Revenue
notes: The table first: what each offer brought, and the one that carried the year.
---
## Three offers, one carried the year

::: table
| Offer | Customers | Revenue | Growth |
|---|--:|--:|--:|
| Starter | 1 240 | 0.4 M€ | +4 % |
| Team | 310 | 1.9 M€ | +18 % |
| Enterprise | 42 | 2.9 M€ | +41 % | {.hero}
:::

---
intent: prove
notes: Quarter by quarter: the curve bends in Q3, when Enterprise opened.
---
## Revenue grew every quarter

::: chart {.bar}
unit: k€
- Q1 | 980
- Q2 | 1 150
- Q3 | 1 420
- Q4 | 1 650 {.hero}
